# Torvus Bog 01_swamp_entrance L0: CFishCloud e00020042 (static model, killable with a death effect,
# repel 0, ball priority 0.6). The player stands in the cloud, shoots it in every beam (KillBoid,
# AddParticles), looks at it in the scan visor (destination alpha), morphs inside it, then
# Deactivate/Activate and Delete.
@f300 god 1; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; give missile 50; give chargeBeam 1; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1; give annihilatorBeam 1
@f320 obj e00020042
@f340 tp 198.2 -91.9 23.2
@f500 shoot e00020042
@f530 shoot e00020042 charged
@f570 shoot e00020042 missile
@f600 beam dark; shoot e00020042
@f640 beam light; shoot e00020042
@f680 beam annihilator; shoot e00020042
@f720 beam power
@f760 shoot e00020042 6
@f800 visor scan
@f900 visor combat
@f950 press x 30
@f1050 boost
@f1100 tp 198.2 -91.9 23.2
@f1200 press x 30
@f1300 send e00020042 Deactivate
@f1400 obj e00020042
@f1450 send e00020042 Activate
@f1600 send e00020042 Delete
@f1700 objs Fish
